# Alterac Mountains & Arathi Highlands (38-39): the Horde quests of Hammerfall, Stromgarde and
# Faldir's Cove in the Arathi Highlands, and those of Tarren Mill in the Alterac Mountains, for a
# Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/alterac_mountains_arathi_highlands_38_39.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Alterac Mountains, area 36;
# Arathi Highlands, area 45). The quest list is section 18 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md.
# Left out: Battle of Warsong Gulch (8427), Conquering Arathi Basin (8436) and Conflict at Darkspear
#   Islands (98887): they want battleground Marks of Honor, won in PvP battlegrounds, not by questing.
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack them): Frostmaw (1136, Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff; its
#   mane is taken here, Badlands hands it in), and for warriors Cyclonian (1712) and Essence of the
#   Exile (1714), both taken from Bath'rah the Windwatcher on an earlier visit to the Alterac
#   Mountains: Cyclonian wants 30 Bloodscalp Tusks from Stranglethorn Vale, so it cannot be started
#   and finished here. The charms of the Essence drop from the Exiles at the Stones of Binding, on
#   this guide's way.
# Left to later guides: Frostmaw (1136, Badlands), Theldurin the Lost (687, Badlands) and Sunken
#   Treasure (669, Booty Bay, in Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows).
# Bought, not farmed: the Liferoot of Cyclonian, in Undercity at the start.
#
# The route: the zeppelin to Undercity and a flight to Hammerfall; the east and middle of the
# highlands (Drywhisker Gorge, the Stones of East and Outer Binding, Go'shek Farm, Boulderfist Hall);
# a loop west (the Stone of West Binding, Stromgarde, the Boulderfist ogres, the Circle of Inner
# Binding); a flight to Tarren Mill for the Alterac Mountains (the gryphons east of Tarren Mill,
# Bath'rah, Strahnbrad, then the Ruins of Alterac, Dalaran and Frostmaw); back to Hammerfall,
# Stromgarde again and Faldir's Cove; and the rest of Zengu's sigils, one trip to Stromgarde each.

guide Alterac Mountains & Arathi Highlands (38-39)
faction horde
levels 38 39
carry 243 1136 1240 1270 1276 1373 1712 1714 95141
leave 243 669 687 1136 1240 1270 1276 1373 95141
next Badlands (39-40)

